#: workspace/khotkeys/data/kde32b1.khotkeys:1038
#: workspace/khotkeys/data/kde32b1.khotkeys:1355
#: workspace/khotkeys/data/kde32b1.khotkeys:2282
#: workspace/khotkeys/data/printscreen.khotkeys:234
